# ---- entities: machines ----
ent-OxydRdConsole = Moebius R&D console
    .desc = Central research console. Links to the destructive analyzer and fabrication machines.

ent-OxydDestructiveAnalyzer = destructive analyzer
    .desc = A hollow chamber that disassembles objects to extract research data.

ent-OxydProtolathe = protolathe
    .desc = Fabricates prototypes from designs unlocked by the R&D console.

ent-OxydCircuitImprinter = circuit imprinter
    .desc = Prints machine and computer circuit boards.

ent-OxydMechfab = exosuit fabricator
    .desc = Produces robotic parts and prosthetics for the robotics lab.

ent-OxydExplosionWatcher = explosion watcher beacon
    .desc = A shock-resistant beacon that banks research data from recorded blasts.

# ---- entities: boards ----
ent-OxydRdConsoleCircuitboard = R&D console (computer board)
    .desc = A computer printed circuit board for the R&D console.

ent-OxydProtolatheBoard = protolathe (machine board)
    .desc = A machine printed circuit board for a protolathe.

ent-OxydCircuitImprinterBoard = circuit imprinter (machine board)
    .desc = A machine printed circuit board for a circuit imprinter.

ent-OxydMechfabBoard = exosuit fabricator (machine board)
    .desc = A machine printed circuit board for an exosuit fabricator.

ent-OxydDestructiveAnalyzerBoard = destructive analyzer (machine board)
    .desc = A machine printed circuit board for a destructive analyzer.

# ---- entities: items ----
ent-OxydScienceTool = science tool
    .desc = A handheld scanner that stores experimental data blocks for upload at the R&D console.

ent-OxydAutopsyScanner = autopsy scanner
    .desc = Scans a corpse and prints an autopsy report for research purposes.

ent-OxydAutopsyReport = autopsy report data block
    .desc = Digitized autopsy findings. Can be loaded into the R&D console.

ent-OxydResearchDataDisk = research data disk
    .desc = A portable drive for storing technology nodes and design blueprints.

ent-OxydResearchPointsDisk = research points disk
    .desc = A portable drive containing a cache of research data points.

ent-OxydNanoManipulator = pico-manipulator
    .desc = A tiny manipulator used in the construction of certain devices.

ent-OxydCellPrototype = prototype power cell
    .desc = An experimental power cell created by the R&D department.

